  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Production and Marketing of High Quality Arabica Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee Value Chain.Beneficiaries: More than 1,354 members and farmers of which 542 are expected to be women and youths..Description: Igamba Coffee AMCOS seeks to sustainably produce and market high quality mild arabica coffee that will command premium prices at the local and export market. .USADF&apos;s funds will be used to improve the capacity of Igamba Mpya AMCOS to produce quality arabica coffee. To achieve this, the project will train farmers on good agricultural practices, establish a revolving fund for purchase of inputs and raw materials, and expand its seedling nursery.</narrative>
  </description>
